Building this service is problematic.

Long story short:
before using autopackage, run (in this order):
sudo apt-get install libc6-dev-i386 libssl0.9.8:i386 libssl-dev:i386
sudo apt-get install devscripts debhelper
sudo apt-get install gcc-multilib 

The problem is that libssl-dev:i386 removes devscripts, debhelper, gcc, binutils, and other things...

For your convenience I pushed a working and tested .deb to the main repository.

